<p>Each time you apply Jinx to an enemy, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">35%, 47%, 55%, 60%, 64%</acronym> chance to siphon some of their luck for yourself for 5 turns. This stacks up to 10 times, increasing saves and defense by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.00, 2.00, 2.00, 3.00, 3.00</acronym> and critical strike chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.00%, 1.00%, 1.50%, 1.50%, 2.00%.</acronym></p><p>If you know Preordain, stacks beyond 6 also grant a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 3%, 3%, 4%, 4%</acronym> chance for you to entirely avoid damage taken.</p>